WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:06.678
"We're here," PJ said.

2
00:00:06.679 --> 00:00:18.855
"Planet Green."

3
00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:27.241
The spaceship landed on a farm.

4
00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:32.768
There were metal poles around a field.

5
00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:38.389
A farmer was holding a rake.

6
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:42.510
"Howdy! I'm Bex," she said.

7
00:00:42.511 --> 00:00:46.296
Ringo smiled. "I'm Ringo.

8
00:00:46.297 --> 00:00:48.838
And this is Lucy."

9
00:00:48.839 --> 00:00:52.648
"We're from Space Patrol," Lucy said.

10
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:55.685
"We don't have enough vegetables."

11
00:00:55.686 --> 00:00:59.450
Bex frowned. "I know.

12
00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:02.652
My crops are dying!"

13
00:01:02.653 --> 00:01:06.037
"Do you know why?" Ringo asked.

14
00:01:06.038 --> 00:01:10.825
Bex nodded. "Vern is killing them!"

15
00:01:10.826 --> 00:01:14.113
"Who's Vern?" Lucy asked.

16
00:01:14.114 --> 00:01:18.590
Bex looked mad. "He's a new farmer.

17
00:01:18.591 --> 00:01:21.593
He wants to destroy my farm.

18
00:01:21.594 --> 00:01:24.672
Then he can make more money."

19
00:01:24.673 --> 00:01:32.663
Ringo looked at the metal poles.

20
00:01:32.664 --> 00:01:36.110
"Do those keep out Vern?" he asked.

21
00:01:36.111 --> 00:01:40.526
Bex shook her head. "They're heat poles.

22
00:01:40.527 --> 00:01:43.215
They keep out worms."

23
00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:46.573
"Let's go talk to Vern," Ringo said.

24
00:01:46.574 --> 00:01:50.117
Suddenly something landed in the field.

25
00:01:50.118 --> 00:01:54.525
Poof! Purple smoke filled the air!

26
00:01:54.526 --> 00:01:58.382
Ringo coughed.

27
00:01:58.383 --> 00:02:00.755
Bex made a fist.

28
00:02:00.756 --> 00:02:05.161
"This smoke kills plants!" she said.

29
00:02:05.162 --> 00:02:07.883
Ringo looked around.

30
00:02:07.884 --> 00:02:11.822
Crops turned gray and drooped.

31
00:02:11.823 --> 00:02:16.287
"Ha-ha!" Someone laughed.

32
00:02:16.288 --> 00:02:19.470
Then an Astro bike started up.

33
00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:26.939
Vroom!

